@page "/privacy-policy"

@using Shared

@layout PoliciesLayout

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy</PageTitle>

<div class="pt-[20%] mb-5 py-20 mt-5">
    <div class="flex justify-center max-w-xl mx-auto px-5 gap-12">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded shadow border border-gray-200">
            <div class="text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.8]">

                <!-- h1 -->
                <h1 class="text-5xl text-green-700 font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>

                <!-- h2 -->
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Data Types and Collection Methods</h2>

                <!-- p -->
                <p class="mb-6"> Pamoja Counselling, Mental Wellbeing and Safeguarding Services is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy outlines how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you use our website and services.</p>
                <p class="mb-6">We collect both information that you provide as well as automated data concerning your use of the website.</p>
                <h3 class="text-[1.4rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Information You Provide</h3>
                <p class="mb-6">We protect the privacy of our users by limiting the amount of personally identifiable information that we collect. You can use many of our pages without needing to provide your personal information.</p>
                <p class="mb-6">However, in order for us to deliver our specialized services, we require that you provide information about yourself. This data may include:</p>

                <!-- ul -->
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Name
                    </li>
                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Email address
                    </li>
                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Phone number
                    </li>
                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Organisation (if applicable)
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <h3 class="text-[1.4rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Automatically Collected Data</h3>
                <p class="mb-6">Like many websites, we use cookies (small files transferred from our website to a user\'s hard drives or browsers) and other similar information-collecting tools to gather certain information automatically.</p>
                <p class="mb-6">The types of information we are able to automatically collect include:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2">IP address (may be processed by our analytics tools)</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Browser type and version</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Device and operating system</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Pages visited, session duration, and interactions with the site</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Approximate location (derived from IP address)</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mb-6">
                    Additionally, the type of information we are able to collect using Google Analytics, as a result of your browser's set cookies may include (but is not limited to):
                    <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                        <li class="mb-2">Clicks</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">Downloads</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">Demographics</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">Referral sites</li>
                    </ul>
                </p>
                <p class="mb-6">For more information on Google Analytics, please visit the <a href="https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/features/">Google Analytics</a> website.</p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">How We Use Your Data</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">We process your personal data and automatically collected information to deliver services to you and to inform you of other benefits or opportunities associated with our services.</p>
                <p class="mb-6">We use your data to:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2">Respond to enquiries and requests</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Provide counselling, wellbeing, and safeguarding services</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Communicate with you about services or updates you request</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Maintain, secure, and improve our website</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Measure website performance and usage via Google Analytics</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Comply with legal and safeguarding obligations</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mb-6">We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data.</p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Legal Bases for Processing</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">Under applicable data protection laws, we rely on the following lawful bases to process your data(as relevant):</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Consent</strong> – where you provide it (e.g. submitting an enquiry form). You can withdraw consent at any time.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Contract / service provision</strong> – where processing is necessary to provide requested services.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Legal obligation</strong> – where we must comply with legal or safeguarding duties.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>Legitimate interests</strong> – to operate, secure, and improve our website and services, where these interests do not override your rights.</li>
                </ul>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">How We Share and Disclose Your Data</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">We may share personal data only where necessary with:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2">With trusted service providers (e.g. website hosting, email services, analytics providers such as Google Analytics)</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Where required by law, regulation, or safeguarding obligations</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mb-6">We require service providers to protect personal data and use it only for the services they provide to us.</p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">International Data Transfers</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">
                    Personal data may be transferred to and processed in <strong>Kenya</strong>. If UK/EU personal data is involved, Kenya is
                    not currently recognised as an adequacy country under UK GDPR. We apply appropriate safeguards, including:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2">Secure hosting and encrypted connections where available (e.g. HTTPS)</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Access controls and confidentiality procedures</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Data minimisation (only collecting what is necessary)</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mb-6">
                    Where third-party providers (such as Google) process data internationally, those transfers are governed by their
                    applicable safeguards and contractual terms.
                </p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">How We Store and Protect Your Data</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">
                    <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                        <li class="mb-2">We store data securely and restrict access to authorised persons only.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">We use appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect personal data.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">We retain personal data only for as long as necessary for the purpose it was collected, or as required by law.</li>
                    </ul>
                </p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Managing Your Information</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">Depending on your location and applicable law, you may at any time:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-6 my-4 mb-6">
                    <li class="mb-2">Access your personal data</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Request deletion/erasure (where applicable)</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Object to or restrict processing</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Request data portability (where applicable)</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">Withdraw consent at any time (where processing is based on consent)</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mb-6">To manage your information, contact us using the details below.</p>
                <h3 class="text-[1.4rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Cookies</h3>
                <p class="mb-6">
                    All new visitors to our website have the option to accept or deny cookies. You can control cookies through your browser settings, including blocking or deleting cookies. If you disable cookies,
                    some parts of the site may not function as intended.
                </p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Contact Information</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy and/or the practices or the use of this site, please email us at 
                    <a href="mailto:pamojamentalhealth@pamojasafeguarding.com" class="text-green-700 hover:text-slate-700 transition-colors">our email</a>
                </p>
                 <h2 class="text-[1.8rem] text-green-700 mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">Changes To This Policy</h2>
                <p class="mb-6">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>